{
  "uid": "lab22-observability",
  "title": "Lab 2.2 — Pedidos e inventario",
  "description": "Señales exportadas por el OpenTelemetry Collector. Las métricas HTTP provienen del Java Agent (http.server.request.duration). CPU y memoria son métricas JVM del proceso, no del nodo.",
  "tags": ["lab22", "otel"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": { "from": "now-30m", "to": "now" },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "service",
        "label": "Servicio",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
        "definition": "label_values(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count, service_name)",
        "query": {
          "qryType": 1,
          "query": "label_values(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count, service_name)",
          "refId": "PrometheusVariableQueryEditor-VariableQuery"
        },
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "refresh": 2,
        "current": { "text": "All", "value": "$__all" }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "1. Tasa de solicitudes HTTP",
      "description": "Fuente: Prometheus. Métrica http_server_request_duration_seconds_count exportada por el Collector desde el histograma http.server.request.duration del Java Agent. Unidad: solicitudes por segundo. Etiqueta service_name.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10 } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (service_name) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{service_name=~\"$service\", http_route=~\"/api/.*\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service_name}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "2. Latencia HTTP p95 y p99",
      "description": "Fuente: Prometheus. histogram_quantile sobre http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket. Unidad: segundos. El histograma lo emite el Java Agent con buckets de la convención HTTP.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "s", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10 } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, service_name) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{service_name=~\"$service\", http_route=~\"/api/.*\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95 {{service_name}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le, service_name) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{service_name=~\"$service\", http_route=~\"/api/.*\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99 {{service_name}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "3. Tasa de errores HTTP 5xx",
      "description": "Fuente: Prometheus. Proporción de solicitudes con http_response_status_code 5xx. Unidad: porcentaje 0-100. Un 404 de pedido inexistente no entra en este panel.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10 }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * (sum by (service_name) (increase(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{service_name=~\"$service\", http_route=~\"/api/.*\", http_response_status_code=~\"5..\"}[$__range])) or (sum by (service_name) (increase(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{service_name=~\"$service\", http_route=~\"/api/.*\"}[$__range])) * 0)) / sum by (service_name) (increase(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{service_name=~\"$service\", http_route=~\"/api/.*\"}[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service_name}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "gauge",
      "title": "4. SLI de disponibilidad",
      "description": "SLI explícito: solicitudes 2xx de rutas /api dividido entre todas las solicitudes /api del rango visible del dashboard. Sin tráfico el resultado no es numérico y el panel queda vacío, en lugar de un falso 0 %. Objetivo de referencia: >= 99.5 % en el camino feliz. Fuente: Prometheus. Unidad: porcentaje.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 8 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 99 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 99.5 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "showThresholdMarkers": true },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "expr": "100 * sum(increase(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{service_name=~\"$service\", http_route=~\"/api/.*\", http_response_status_code=~\"2..\"}[$__range])) / sum(increase(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{service_name=~\"$service\", http_route=~\"/api/.*\"}[$__range]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "5. CPU y memoria de los servicios",
      "description": "Fuente: Prometheus. jvm_cpu_recent_utilization es la utilización reciente de CPU del proceso Java (razón 0-1, mostrada como porcentaje). jvm_memory_used_bytes{jvm_memory_type=\"heap\"} es el heap usado. No es la CPU del nodo: el agente no ve cgroups ajenos.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 8 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": {}, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "showHeader": true, "cellHeight": "sm" },
      "transformations": [
        { "id": "merge", "options": {} },
        { "id": "organize", "options": { "excludeByName": { "Time": true, "__name__": true, "instance": true, "job": true }, "renameByName": { "service_name": "Servicio", "Value #A": "CPU", "Value #B": "Heap" } } }
      ],
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table",
          "expr": "max by (service_name) (jvm_cpu_recent_utilization_ratio{service_name=~\"$service\"})",
          "legendFormat": ""
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table",
          "expr": "sum by (service_name) (jvm_memory_used_bytes{service_name=~\"$service\", jvm_memory_type=\"heap\"})",
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "6. Salud del OpenTelemetry Collector",
      "description": "Fuente: Prometheus, scrape del endpoint interno :8888. otelcol_exporter_sent_spans_total son spans exportados. otelcol_exporter_send_failed_spans_total son fallos de exportación. otelcol_processor_refused_spans_total son spans rechazados por memory_limiter. Unidad: eventos por segundo.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 16, "x": 0, "y": 16 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "ops", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10 } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(otelcol_exporter_sent_spans_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "spans exportados"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum(rate(otelcol_exporter_send_failed_spans_total[5m])) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "fallos de exportación de spans"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "sum(rate(otelcol_processor_refused_spans_total[5m])) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "spans rechazados"
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "expr": "sum(rate(otelcol_exporter_send_failed_log_records_total[5m])) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "fallos de exportación de logs"
        },
        {
          "refId": "E",
          "expr": "sum(rate(otelcol_exporter_send_failed_metric_points_total[5m])) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "fallos de exportación de métricas"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Collector en scrape",
      "description": "up del job otel-collector. 1 significa que Prometheus está leyendo :8888.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 16 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "instant": true, "expr": "up{job=\"otel-collector\"}" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
